{"id":"c841e01cb6138ecc","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-set12-reindexed-family.md","title":"ZFC Set12 Reindexed Family","display":"df-zfc-set12-reindexed-family — ZFC Set12 Reindexed Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set12-reindexed-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set12-reindexed-family"],"display":"df-zfc-set12-reindexed-family — ZFC Set12 Reindexed Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set12-reindexed-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set12-reindexed-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set12-reindexed-family — ZFC Set12 Reindexed Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,I,X,h,J,G\\in V\">\\(F,I,X,h,J,G\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ReindexedFamily}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ReindexedFamily}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}reindexed\\text{-}family}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ReindexedFamily}_S(G,F,h,J)\\leftrightarrow\\exists I,X\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,J,I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(G,J,X)\\land\\forall j\\in J\\;(G(j)=F(h(j)))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}reindexed\\text{-}family}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ReindexedFamily}_S(G,F,h,J)\\leftrightarrow\\exists I,X\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,J,I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(G,J,X)\\land\\forall j\\in J\\;(G(j)=F(h(j)))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The source family, index map, and composite family are all total functions with compatible domains and codomains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,I,X,h,J,G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ReindexedFamily}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}reindexed\\text{-}family}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ReindexedFamily}_S(G,F,h,J)\\leftrightarrow\\exists I,X\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(F,I,X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,J,I)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(G,J,X)\\land\\forall j\\in J\\;(G(j)=F(h(j)))\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":920,"backlinks":[{"id":"8